  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Super sharp 2022 Barletta Corsa...</strong></p><p>Black-out arch and rails, along with matte black panels, give this one a stealth vibe, and metallic blue accents add true class.&nbsp; Step inside and the white/grey/blue vinyl pattern rounds out the best of the Barletta high-end look.&nbsp; From there, her long list of features and options make this boat an ideal platform for fun with the family, entertaining...and impressing.&nbsp; 200HP Mercury with only 65 hours provides plenty of power.&nbsp; Comes complete with matched Mid-America trailer.&nbsp;</p><p>Take a look today in Quest's Ottawa, IL showroom...&nbsp;</p>",
